# Campus Route Finder

A C++ console application for finding routes between campus locations.

## Programming Language
C++

## Algorithms
- Breadth-First Search (BFS)
- Depth-First Search (DFS)
- Dijkstra's Shortest Path Algorithm

## Features
- Displays campus locations.
- Accepts starting and destination locations.
- Finds routes using BFS and DFS.
- Finds the shortest-distance route using Dijkstra.
- Displays the route and total distance.

## How to Run
1. Open main.cpp in a C++ compiler.
2. Compile and run the program.
3. Select an algorithm.
4. Enter the starting and destination locations.

## Note
The road connections and distances are illustrative
and must be updated to match the actual campus map.